==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~23.33 seconds<sup>300f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hermit Peng]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

